nothing does, so the result is the 0-array:\
\>", "ExampleText",ExpressionUUID->"e72cb8fb-127c-784c-99b1-6f37d39f0d1f"],

Cell["ArrayMultiply[{{1, 2, 3}, {4, 5, 6}}, \"i,i\"]", "Input",ExpressionUUID->"cc5904a6-cefa-614a-b8a6-24db2de4e1b4"],

